  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community tourism in Meanguera, Morazn</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Working with Asociacin Cooperativa Mezcal, Historia y Color, Asociacin Comunal Comit de Desarrollo Turstico de Meanguera (CDT- Meanguera) will help farmers in Morazn and microentrepreneurs generate income from tourism and other sources. The program includes training in production of crafts, the diversification of agriculture and food- processing and related technical assistance; support accessing markets; and the promotion of local attractions, products and services. The work should benefit 100 residents of Meanguera directly and 500 indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
